description: Review implementation plans against live repository truth with explicit coverage, claim-level evidence, post-correction re-derivation, and a frozen-state readiness verdict. Use before implementation or ratification, or when asked whether one or more plans are complete, coherent, executable, or implementation-ready; do not use for ordinary code review or roadmap critique.
